            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a haul truck body arranged to have a specific nominal payload capacity. The haul truck body comprising an outer load carrying structure which has a front wall, two opposing side walls, and a bottom. The haul truck body further comprises an inner load carrying structure arranged at inner surfaces of said outer load carrying structure, wherein neither the outer load carrying structure nor the inner load carrying structure alone is arranged to carry said specific nominal payload.</p>
